{"4524700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CHARGE.R", "steam_appid": 4524700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES ARE THE CORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CHARGE.R, every location is a puzzle space filled with various tasks related to restoring energy — an obstacle that must be overcome through logic, sequence and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battles. No enemies. Just you, the station, mechanisms, diverse energy sources, switches, puzzles, gravitational manipulations and other tools that open the way forward. Use your logic skills and connection skills to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/1453bf5dbf58cc601e325ff0bcbac8f4.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/1453bf5dbf58cc601e325ff0bcbac8f4.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/1453bf5dbf58cc601e325ff0bcbac8f4.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/947380726aa29fe98b1e035141434847.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/947380726aa29fe98b1e035141434847.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/947380726aa29fe98b1e035141434847.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/273ed3ae3724d38c723e9ccdae6ba4bf.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/273ed3ae3724d38c723e9ccdae6ba4bf.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/273ed3ae3724d38c723e9ccdae6ba4bf.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STORY UNFOLDED STEP BY STEP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2041. A meteor struck the Earth. This event not only marked the beginning of a catastrophe but also the dawn of a New Era — the end of all wars and humanity unification. Artificial intelligence took the role of civilization mediator and controller, guiding the development towards the future. A rapid leap in technology opens the way for the next phase of space exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Moon became a bastion of defense. It was here, the remote place where the Earth defense system against space threats was established. On its dark side, six stations were built, each shaped like a giant ring, hidden deep within craters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the technical space, hazardous to humans, there was another realm where people could survive. Uncover the truth about what really happened in the depths of this complex and what secrets the station hides. Each puzzle is a fragment of lost history revealed through the environment, terminals, audio logs, and holograms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/0f54de360471a02e88045bb0352f2978.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/0f54de360471a02e88045bb0352f2978.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/0f54de360471a02e88045bb0352f2978.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/df66c237814e5aec0211260e20eab4b2.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/df66c237814e5aec0211260e20eab4b2.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/df66c237814e5aec0211260e20eab4b2.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/77832f24ea0e4f4cfc54c140bc5975a5.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/77832f24ea0e4f4cfc54c140bc5975a5.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/77832f24ea0e4f4cfc54c140bc5975a5.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FROM THE DEVELOPERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, it's just the three amigos and we’re in love with Sci-Fi. Mystery, secrecy, space, and the potential future - these are the things that fill our minds and subconscious. This game partially reflects these markers and echoes of classics like 2001: A Space Odyssey, Portal and The Turing Test. So if you see those influences, that's perfectly fine. But we’re also aiming to bring something unique. We’re looking forward to different forms of energy, and what humanity might actually create on the Moon in the future. This won’t only be a launching pad for space missions but also a place to defend Earth from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES ARE THE CORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CHARGE.R, every location is a puzzle space filled with various tasks related to restoring energy — an obstacle that must be overcome through logic, sequence and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battles. No enemies. Just you, the station, mechanisms, diverse energy sources, switches, puzzles, gravitational manipulations and other tools that open the way forward. Use your logic skills and connection skills to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/1453bf5dbf58cc601e325ff0bcbac8f4.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/1453bf5dbf58cc601e325ff0bcbac8f4.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/1453bf5dbf58cc601e325ff0bcbac8f4.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/947380726aa29fe98b1e035141434847.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/947380726aa29fe98b1e035141434847.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/947380726aa29fe98b1e035141434847.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/273ed3ae3724d38c723e9ccdae6ba4bf.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/273ed3ae3724d38c723e9ccdae6ba4bf.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/273ed3ae3724d38c723e9ccdae6ba4bf.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STORY UNFOLDED STEP BY STEP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2041. A meteor struck the Earth. This event not only marked the beginning of a catastrophe but also the dawn of a New Era — the end of all wars and humanity unification. Artificial intelligence took the role of civilization mediator and controller, guiding the development towards the future. A rapid leap in technology opens the way for the next phase of space exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Moon became a bastion of defense. It was here, the remote place where the Earth defense system against space threats was established. On its dark side, six stations were built, each shaped like a giant ring, hidden deep within craters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the technical space, hazardous to humans, there was another realm where people could survive. Uncover the truth about what really happened in the depths of this complex and what secrets the station hides. Each puzzle is a fragment of lost history revealed through the environment, terminals, audio logs, and holograms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/0f54de360471a02e88045bb0352f2978.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/0f54de360471a02e88045bb0352f2978.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/0f54de360471a02e88045bb0352f2978.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/df66c237814e5aec0211260e20eab4b2.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/df66c237814e5aec0211260e20eab4b2.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/df66c237814e5aec0211260e20eab4b2.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/77832f24ea0e4f4cfc54c140bc5975a5.poster.avif?t=1774291364\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/77832f24ea0e4f4cfc54c140bc5975a5.webm?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/extras/77832f24ea0e4f4cfc54c140bc5975a5.mp4?t=1774291364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FROM THE DEVELOPERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, it's just the three amigos and we’re in love with Sci-Fi. Mystery, secrecy, space, and the potential future - these are the things that fill our minds and subconscious. This game partially reflects these markers and echoes of classics like 2001: A Space Odyssey, Portal and The Turing Test. So if you see those influences, that's perfectly fine. But we’re also aiming to bring something unique. We’re looking forward to different forms of energy, and what humanity might actually create on the Moon in the future. This won’t only be a launching pad for space missions but also a place to defend Earth from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A sci-fi puzzle game set in the body of a robot on an abandoned lunar station following a catastrophic event. The station was once part of Earth's defense against cosmic threats. All that remains are voices from the past. Now, it lies silent. The ring system have shut down and needs to be recharged.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/bd3e51fd441b1d254e529413e9d6e577f01d56af/header.jpg?t=1774291364", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524700/5537a31a03ce20f7597580c5d6b8637d73c61032/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774291364", "capsule_ima